# game/storybeat.rpy:1070
translate hindi story_beat3_c14acb61:

    # robin "Yea... it was."
    robin "हाँ... यह था."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1071
translate hindi story_beat3_9083d04c:

    # robin "It was manageable though, it's just the internet right?"
    robin "हालाँकि यह प्रबंधनीय था, यह सिर्फ इंटरनेट है ना?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1074
translate hindi story_beat3_d60ad138:

    # robin "Well, at least thats what I thought..."
    robin "खैर, कम से कम मैंने तो यही सोचा था..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1078
translate hindi story_beat3_2aa7acdd:

    # robin "About a month ago, I heard a knock on my door really late at night."
    robin "लगभग एक महीने पहले, मैंने देर रात अपने दरवाजे पर दस्तक सुनी।"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1079
translate hindi story_beat3_0a4f663a:

    # robin "I lived by myself in an apartment, so I thought it was weird."
    robin "मैं एक अपार्टमेंट में अकेला रहता था, इसलिए मुझे लगा कि यह अजीब है।"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1081
translate hindi story_beat3_b3fd2eca:

    # robin "But I opened it anyways, and..."
    robin "लेकिन फिर भी मैंने इसे खोला, और..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1085
translate hindi story_beat3_ee849a7b:

    # robin "He was there..."
    robin "वह वहां था..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1086
translate hindi story_beat3_283dedc6:

    # robin "Somehow, one of the creeps online found out where I lived..."
    robin "किसी तरह, ऑनलाइन धोखेबाज़ों में से एक को पता चल गया कि मैं कहाँ रहता हूँ..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1087
translate hindi story_beat3_7278c67b:

    # pro "What the fuck..."
    pro "क्या बकवास है..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1088
translate hindi story_beat3_84089f4b:

    # robin "I... I was so scared."
    robin "मैं... मैं बहुत डर गया था।"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1089
translate hindi story_beat3_2d182e8a:

    # robin "I froze and he..."
    robin "मैं ठिठक गया और वह..."

